message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Uncertainty-Aware Neural Surrogate for Parametric L-Bracket Stress Prediction"
authors:
  - family-names: Mathur
    given-names: Arpit
    email: retroranger24@gmail.com
version: "camera-ready"
date-released: 2026-07-18
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/retroranger04/uq-stress-surrogate-lbracket"
abstract: >
  A MeshGraphNets-style GNN surrogate for 2D plane-stress von Mises stress
  prediction on a parametric flat L-bracket, wrapped in a deployment-calibrated
  reliability layer combining a 5-member Deep Ensemble with conformalized
  quantile regression. Includes pre-registered out-of-distribution evaluation
  and a defer-to-FEA decision rule.
keywords:
  - uncertainty quantification
  - conformal prediction
  - graph neural networks
  - deep ensembles
  - structural mechanics
  - neural surrogates
  - finite element analysis
  - out-of-distribution detection
